msgid "This site cannot fetch its own pages (prerequisites.loopback.reason), so nothing can be measured over MCP yet. If a firewall or CDN in front of the site blocks it, set update-settings loopback_origin to the origin server's address (ask the host); if the site is behind HTTP basic auth, set loopback_credentials. Then call get-capabilities again."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-abilities-control.php:436
