#: includes/class-sspa-abilities-control.php:458
msgid "A run moves while the Performance Analysis screen is open, and when WP-Cron fires on site traffic."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-abilities-control.php:462
msgid "The profiler is off. Measurements need it: the site owner turns it on in Performance Analysis > Tools."
msgstr ""

#: includes/class-sspa-abilities-control.php:465
msgid "No analysis has finished yet. The site owner starts one from the Performance Analysis screen; these abilities then read every result."
